# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and local
# state out of the daemon's view of this directory.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded: models.json. The Dockerfile bakes it in, because
# an image without price data reports $0.00 costs while claiming it priced
# them. Do not add it here.

# Version control and the tool's own session transcripts: not build inputs, and
# .git in particular is large and has no business in a layer.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.opencode

# Local databases. Rebuilt by a scan, machine-specific, and private.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Compiled output and test binaries.
dashd
dashd.exe
*.test
coverage.out
coverage.html
dist/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Docs and packaging are not needed to compile or run the binary, and the
# image fetches nothing back in: the runtime stage copies only the binary and
# models.json.
README.md
packaging/
Makefile

# Python bytecode from update_models.py.
__pycache__/
*.pyc